exports[`方言画廊 —— 渲染侧 parity > full（全功能样例） 1`] = `
"<h1>nexusdown 方言画廊</h1><p>这是 <strong>加粗</strong>、<em>斜体</em>、<em><strong>粗斜体</strong></em>、<s>删除线</s>、<code>行内代码</code>、<mark class="nd-highlight">高亮</mark> 的混排。</p><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://example.com">链接</a> 和自动链接 <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://github.com/NexusMC-CN/nexusdown">https://github.com/NexusMC-CN/nexusdown</a>。</p><blockquote><p>普通引用块。</p></blockquote><div class="nd-callout nd-callout--tip"><p class="nd-callout__title"><span class="nd-callout__icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span class="nd-callout__label">提示</span></p><p>提示块（callout）也是引用块，首行是 <code>[!TYPE]</code>。</p></div><h2>列表</h2><ul><li><p>无序项</p></li><li><p>第二项</p><ul><li><p>嵌套项</p></li></ul></li></ul><ol><li><p>有序项</p></li><li><p>第二项</p></li></ol><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><input type="checkbox"/><span/></label><div><p>待办</p></div></li><li data-checked="true" data-type="taskItem"><label><input type="checkbox" checked="checked"/><span/></label><div><p>已完成</p></div></li></ul><h2>表格</h2><table><tbody><tr><th style="text-align:left"><p>左对齐</p></th><th style="text-align:center"><p>居中</p></th><th style="text-align:right"><p>右对齐</p></th></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left"><p>1</p></td><td style="text-align:center"><p>2</p></td><td style="text-align:right"><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left"><p><mark class="nd-highlight">高亮</mark></p></td><td style="text-align:center"><p><code>code</code></p></td><td style="text-align:right"><p><strong>粗</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>代码</h2><div class="nd-code-fence"><div class="nd-code-header" contenteditable="false"><span class="nd-code-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="nd-code-file"><span class="nd-code-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path fill="#007acc" d="M23.827 8.243a4.4 4.4 0 0 1 2.223 1.281a6 6 0 0 1 .852 1.143c